WEBVTT

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.320
Come forth, titan!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.510
Great! Miss Corona is fast enough
to create from that range!

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.770
Einhart! Kitty cat!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.980
Stop the creation!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.200
In the name of your creator, Corona,
and her device, Brunzel...

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.570
smash and bash, Goliath!

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.920
Rock Bind.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.470
Gigant Knuckle!

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.950
Alright!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.550
Competitor Einhart down!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.090
Count: One...

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.470
Two...

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.210
Corona sure is amazing.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.310
Yeah.

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:09.250
Three...

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:11.930
But Einhart-san isn't done yet, either.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.480
You're probably right.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.040
Four...

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.910
The competitors are ready!
Match resume!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.500
Fight!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.460
Grand Gazer!

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.580
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.100
Sky Schism!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.940
Teo, lend me your strength!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.570
Hegemon Style...

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.070
Battering Ram!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:21.340
Einhart has demolished the golem!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:26.040
At the same time,
Corona, ring out, down!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.560
Nove! Miss Corona is...!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:32.680
Calm down! It's not over yet.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:41.920
In terms of strength, physique, or magical capacity,
she's not the best on the team in any category.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.950
But when Corona is in a pinch,
she stays calm and doesn't crack.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.120
She has the wits and tactics to win.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:56.220
She's the most intelligent and creative of the four of them.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.170
But in that condition...

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.290
Don't worry.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.050
She hasn't really used her weapon yet.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:11.300
Competitor Corona, ring in!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.990
<i>Twenty seconds left in round one...</i>

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:20.060
<i>If she heals during the interval,
anything could happen.</i>

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:26.440
<i>But Corona-san doesn't have counters
or hand-to-hand skills like Vivio-san.</i>

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.960
<i>At this rate, it'll come down to close combat!</i>

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.490
<i>During my first year at St. Hilde...</i>

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:40.960
<i>I met Vivio and we became friends.</i>

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:46.170
<i>I was really surprised when
I heard her talking about martial arts.</i>

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:50.470
<i>I enjoyed being around her,
so I started practicing with her.</i>

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:55.220
<i>I wasn't really sure whether I liked martial arts or not.</i>

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.780
<i>But I was afraid that if I stopped,
I'd lose Vivio as a friend.</i>

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:08.650
<i>Honestly, I just couldn't excel or have fun like Vivio.</i>

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:13.120
<i>I kept thinking so many times that I should just quit.</i>

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:18.080
<i>Nove always encouraged me
and guided me through those times.</i>

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:25.210
<i>Vivio loves martial arts, is eager to grow stronger,
and is always charming.</i>

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:31.590
<i>Rio acts cool as she strives
to master her Shining Spring Fist.</i>

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:40.430
<i>And the always noble Einhart-san struggles to fulfill
her ancestor's dying wish to obtain true strength.</i>

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:47.020
<i>As a member of that team,
I just don't want to disgrace it.</i>

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:54.160
I want to share this time with everyone
and keep up with them for a little longer.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.200
Corona is just standing there!

00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:59.580
That seems dangerous!

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.170
<i>That's why...</i>

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.290
<i>even if it hurts...</i>

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:08.880
<i>I'll use it!</i>

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:12.260
Nephilim Fist!

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.420
What a devastating blow!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.110
Einhart isn't moving!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.370
Count: One...

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:42.370
Wasn't that your Axel Smash and Revolver Spike?

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:41.940
Two...

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.490
Yeah.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.070
Three...

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.800
<i>I was able to perform the Nephilim Fist properly.</i>

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.110
Four...

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.930
<i>This could end it!</i>

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:56.740
Five...

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:00.560
Six...

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.770
Can competitor Einhart get up?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:03.750
Seven...

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.500
Eight...

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.800
She's up! At count eight!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:18.490
But her life is
dangerously low!

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.250
There's no way to predict this match!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:28.000
<i>I underestimated Corona-san's ability
to counter hand-to-hand.</i>

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.400
<i>I can't finish her in this state.</i>

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.430
<i>Ten seconds left...</i>

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.530
<i>There's no time to create.</i>

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.010
Wristlet Form.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:48.200
<i>I'll have to use Nephilim Fist!</i>

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.980
Now then, match resume!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.810
Miss Corona's amazing!
Since when could she do that?!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.040
Come on...

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:12.380
Finish it here!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:39.280
A brutal direct hit!
But that's the end of round one!

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:43.990
Einhart barely had any life left!

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:51.650
Corona's technique was my Roaring Tiger.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.590
Nephilim Fist is probably...

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.630
Body automation?

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:00.860
Right.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:05.560
She's using her golem manipulation ability on her own body.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:09.290
It's the power that she uses to move that enormous golem.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:13.320
When she uses that attack, it's like a giant's fist.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:21.700
She probably programmed the movements ahead of time
and set them to automatically trigger.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:26.790
I see. She reacts to specific attacks
by automatically retaliating.

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.280
So it's a zero response time auto-counter, huh?

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.370
Do you have a plan?

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:32.750
I do.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.920
I remembered something.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.030
I'll show you this next round.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.900
Nephilim Fist's operation is stable.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.220
So this round, I'll force hand-to-hand!

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:50.930
Right!

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:16.080
I knew she could do it!

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.800
With that technique,
she can win in hand-to-hand!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.050
Yeah.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.430
Round two commence!

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.840
Nephilim Fist activate!

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.990
Close Combat Rush Mode!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.270
System load.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.080
<i>Leading with a quick combo...</i>

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.440
<i>She's copied Vivio-san's movements perfectly!</i>

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:43.760
Stun Knuckle.

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.640
<i>Nove-san's Stun Knuckle...</i>

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.470
<i>Here comes her counter!</i>

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:53.290
Switch modes: Total Defense!

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.470
<i>This form is Shining Spring Fist.</i>

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:00.000
<i>Here comes her auto-counter...</i>

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.550
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.030
<i>Now I can read her!</i>

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:16.400
<i>The auto-counter's speed and
her own movements are at their limits.</i>

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.670
She can't counter!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:26.160
It's not just that.
Her accuracy is dropping, too.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.990
But how can that be?

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:31.620
It's easy for body automation to develop delays.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:36.580
If the reaction time lags at all,
it could be fatal in a real fight.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:40.340
But if her attacks are powerful enough,
that flaw shouldn't matter.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.840
That may be true...

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:47.430
Nephilim Fist: Meister Arm!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:52.180
<i>Body automation and relentless unarmed combat...</i>

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:55.640
<i>Those tactics...</i>

00:12:56.990 --> 00:13:00.270
<i>have tormented me for six hundred years!</i>

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:20.010
Einhart delivers an intense blow!

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:27.090
But wait! Corona is still standing!
The down counter didn't even start!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.730
<i>It hurts! It hurts!</i>

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:32.780
<i>It hurts, but I can keep going.</i>

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:37.060
<i>I'll use my left for a Revolver Cannon
and then a Spike combination!</i>

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.050
<i>Steel Form...</i>

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.060
<i>Fang Mountain!</i>

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.870
<i>She blocked a fatal blow with her left!</i>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.870
<i>It's an offensive guard that
redirects her opponent's power!</i>

00:13:58.870 --> 00:13:59.750
Crap!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:08.280
Corona's own attacks are being used against her!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:12.180
And now Einhart's followup!

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.430
<i>Here comes her fist!</i>

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.890
<i>It's okay.
The auto-counter will activate!</i>

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:20.640
<i>Oh cr—</i>

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:28.860
Competitor Corona down!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.430
Count: One...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:36.540
<i>She was able to predict the auto-counter's activation delay and retaliate.</i>

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.430
Two...

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.340
<i>The strike sending her upward even
caused extra damage when she hit the floor.</i>

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:40.600
Three...

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:43.000
<i>A perfect strategy.</i>

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.420
Shit!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.000
Corona! Miss Corona!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:45.610
Four...

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:51.220
<i>That offensive guard crushed her fist and leg!</i>

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.530
Five...

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.650
<i>Her heart could be damaged, too.</i>

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.160
Six...

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.880
Corona!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.820
I'm...

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.380
okay.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.130
My Meister Arts and Nephilim Fist...

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.750
Now I'll show you their true forms.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:24.080
What's this?!
Competitor Corona is standing up!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.250
It's not over yet!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.470
Nephilim Fist: Full Control Mode!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:38.050
Full body manipulation!
And she's channeling the force externally!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:48.020
Their design sort of makes me look like a puppet.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:53.340
But now I can move these arms around!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.490
See? Like this.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.020
I'll be okay.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.910
I may not look it,
but I'm pretty strong!

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:06.860
Corona-san has struggled to get this far, too.

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.760
Phantom Dive.

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.510
<i>She blocked it?!</i>

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.350
<i>Regardless...</i>

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:30.070
<i>I'll do it as many times as it takes!</i>

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.870
<i>Her bones are broken.</i>

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.520
<i>Her arms are shattered, yet she can fight.</i>

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.930
<i>Completely external full body manipulation...</i>

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:47.170
<i>In other words, she can keep moving
even after passing her limit and damaging her body!</i>

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:53.640
<i>A competitive fighter from such a peaceful era
shouldn't be using a technique like this!</i>

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:03.160
<i>My hand... my foot... my whole body hurts!</i>

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.140
<i>Even my final trump card can't connect!</i>

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.250
<i>Maybe it's useless.</i>

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.110
<i>No matter how hard I try against Einhart-san...</i>

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:17.680
<i>Crap! Her heart is giving out!</i>

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:18.530
Coro—

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.960
Miss Corona!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:26.580
You haven't used all of your training yet!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.670
The strength you showed when we practiced!

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:33.080
The way a Golem Meister fights!

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:35.170
Show them that you won't give up!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:40.180
Even without some secret ability
or that excessive fighting style...

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.760
You're still strong!

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.780
Sorry.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.120
Thanks, Otto.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.080
You're right.

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:59.580
I may be a martial artist, but also...

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.780
Tact Form.

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.360
<i>She canceled the manipulation.</i>

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.190
<i>Is she switching to magical combat?</i>

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.470
Teo, full power to defense!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.330
Caging Spears!

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.230
Sorry, Brunzel.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.590
One more time...

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.220
Yes, anytime!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:28.770
In the name of your creator, Corona,
and her device, Brunzel...

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:31.270
resurrect, titan!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.530
Smash and bash, Goliath!

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:48.340
<i>I can take out the Goliath with a Battering Ram...</i>

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.540
Meister Arm...

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.040
Spiral Finger!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:04.250
Practice is tough, huh?

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:09.100
Wondering why you should bother to keep at it?

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.020
Well...

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:16.400
But it's all for the sake of working
toward everyone's greatest moment.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.480
Greatest moment?

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:22.070
When that technique you've been practicing hits...

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:25.210
When you feel the satisfaction of an impact...

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:29.450
When you realize you've grown stronger than you were...

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:36.420
I want you guys to experience that moment,
so I have to put you through some rough practices.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:41.560
And I want you to know the joy
of overcoming those obstacles.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.260
<i>That's right!</i>

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:46.600
Comet Blast!

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.510
Shoot!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.940
<i>Nove taught me...</i>

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.650
<i>the joy of growing stronger.</i>

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:06.030
<i>And Otto guided me
and was always happy to see me improve.</i>

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.470
<i>The things that I have to prove...</i>

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.790
<i>The things that I can be proud of...</i>

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:15.790
<i>I shouldn't worry about having the best techniques.</i>

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:22.630
<i>I've got my team, my coach, everyone,
and the fruits of all our training!</i>

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.840
Rock Bind!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.820
Einhart!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:36.690
She's okay!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.410
Thanks, Teo!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.590
This is it!

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:57.120
Brunzel! Goliath!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:57.870
Yes!

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.810
Purge Blast!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.970
Drill Crasher Punch!

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.300
Hegemon Style...

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.730
Cyclonic Counter!

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.280
<i>This is my absolute final attack!</i>

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:26.260
Hegemon...

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.520
Sky-Splitting Fist!

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.790
Match concluded!

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:55.980
Competitor Einhart wins!

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:35.120
What a great match!
They sure did their best.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:36.920
Yeah, they really did.

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:40.550
Ah, next time, Lyrical Magical,
we'll do our best!
